            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ngoc",
            "review_text": "Michelle T\nLondon, United Kingdom48 contributions\n1\nBest pho in Saigon\nDec 2019\nThis super tasty joint was around the corner from our hotel. It is only open for breakfast but it is worth skipping the hotel breakfast for. This is proper streetfood with makeshift tables and roof but the broth was incredibly beefy and meat generous servings and much better than the no1 place for pho in HCM. If you are in the neighborhood one not to miss! A hidden gem for sure!\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
