            "review_text": "Ric1969\nSydney, Australia54 contributions\n0\nDelicious little street rstaurant\nDec 2018\nE went here on the r commendation of Luke Nguyen (Australian celebrity chef) and loved the food and atmosphere. The only thing I would suggest is that if you don’t like your meat a bit fatty then let them know and they will remove it for you. Most locals like the extra bit of fat since they don’t eat a lot of meat, but personally I like the fat removed. The staff were lovely and happy for us to take a fe20' Core Fit. touristy photos of the place.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2019",
