            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ngoc",
            "review_text": "LiReverie\n84 contributions\n0\nYummy and friendly!\nOct 2017 • Couples\nSince my grandma makes the best pho and it was only around the corner; I dragged myself out of bed at 8AM and ran through the pouring rain! It's almost as good as my grandma's, plus you get all the basil, the chillies, limes etc and choices of beef and broth. It's 50,000dong for regular but the portions are large, and I eat a lot. The food was almost as good as home food, but the hospitality was the best I've had in ho chi Minh. Before I left they gave me a rain coat and helped me put it on -which must have looked hilarious to anyone watching because for ages my head couldn't fit through. Overall, amazing experience, even on your own (had to leave the boyfriend sleeping coz it was too early for him). If you're an early bird staying in the area then you should pop in.\nRead more\nWritten October 2, 2017",
